#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:1
msgid "Refactor `vtkCollection` to use `std::vector` instead of a linked list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:3
msgid ""
"`vtkCollection` now uses an `std::vector` instead of a linked list, "
"improving runtime performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:5
msgid "Its public API and behaviour have not changed at all, except:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:7
msgid ""
"The class `vtkCollectionElement`, being a representation of a linked list "
"node, has been removed, without any deprecation period. Although it appeared "
"in `vtkCollection.h`, it wasn't exactly public API, and no uses of it could "
"be found in various open source consumers of VTK (ParaView, Slicer, ITK, "
"Horos)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:9
msgid ""
"Two `protected` member functions (RemoveElement and DeleteElement) and "
"several `protected` member variables were removed. All of these involved "
"`vtkCollectionElement` and thus could not be deprecated. This may affect "
"subclassers. All of VTK's own subclasses have been updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:11
msgid ""
"A new `Sort()` member function was added. It takes an `std::function` and "
"sorts itself using that. VTK subclasses (`vtkActor2DCollection` and "
"`vtkImageSliceCollection`) that did their own sorting were updated to use "
"this new mechanism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:13
msgid ""
"The `NewIterator()` member function was deprecated since "
"`vtkCollectionIterator` itself is now deprecated. Use `vtk::Range` for range-"
"based for loops instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:15
msgid ""
"The default and `protected` constructors of the class `CollectionIterator`, "
"defined in `vtkCollectionRange.h`, have been removed. Use the new "
"constructor which properly initializes its new `Iterator` member."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCollection-refactor-to-use-stdvector.md:19
msgid ""
"`GetNextPath` is tagged with `VTK_MARSHAL_EXCLUDE_REASON_NOT_SUPPORTED`."
msgstr ""
